WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.060
Standing and crouching light punches begin the cash-out route.

2
00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:02.060
The first Drive Rush light conversion connects.

3
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:02.760
